TI  - A case report of wandering spleen with pedicle torsion and splenic infarction being misdiagnosed as organ inversion complicated with acute appendicitis
T2  - FRONTIERS IN SURGERY
LA  - English
KW  - wandering spleen
KW  - pedicle torsion
KW  - acute abdomen
