TI  - An unusual case of hemoperitoneum owing to acute splenic torsion in a child with immunoglobulin deficiency
T2  - JOURNAL OF POSTGRADUATE MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - IgA deficiency
KW  - spleen torsion
KW  - splenomegaly
