TI  - Prognosis for Acute Nontraumatic Hemoperitoneum in the Dog: A Retrospective Analysis of 60 Cases (2003-2006)
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN ANIMAL HOSPITAL ASSOCIATION
LA  - English
KW  - SPLENECTOMY
KW  - HEMANGIOSARCOMA
KW  - ARRHYTHMIAS
