TI  - An infarcted wandering spleen leading to a sigmoid volvulus presenting with acute large bowel obstruction: a case report
T2  - ANNALS OF THE ROYAL COLLEGE OF SURGEONS OF ENGLAND
LA  - English
KW  - Sigmoid volvulus
