TI  - Splenic cyst in a wandering spleen: laparoscopic treatment with preservation of splenic function
T2  - JOURNAL OF PEDIATRIC SURGERY
LA  - English
KW  - wandering spleen
KW  - splenic cyst
KW  - splenopexy
