TI  - Gastric ulceration subsequent to partial invagination of the stomach in a dog with gastric dilatation-volvulus
T2  - JAVMA-JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN VETERINARY MEDICAL ASSOCIATION
LA  - English
KW  - HELICOBACTER SPP. INFECTION
KW  - PARTIAL GASTRECTOMY
