TI  - Wandering Lymphoma: A Case of Wandering Spleen Secondary to Splenic Marginal Zone Lymphoma
T2  - CASE REPORTS IN HEMATOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - lymphoma
KW  - splenectomy
KW  - splenic marginal zone lymphoma
