TI  - Torsion of Wandering Spleen Attached to the Omentum: A Rare Case Report from Iran
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF GENERAL MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - ectopic spleen
KW  - spleen torsion
KW  - splenectomy
