TI  - Single-Incision Laparoscopic Approach to Management of Splenic Pathology in Children: An Early Experience
T2  - JOURNAL OF LAPAROENDOSCOPIC & ADVANCED SURGICAL TECHNIQUES
LA  - English
KW  - INITIAL-EXPERIENCE
