TI  - Wandering spleen: An unsuspected presentation at a general hospital in Uganda
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SURGERY CASE REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - Wandering spleen
KW  - Intrabdominal tumor
KW  - Low-income setting
KW  - CT scan
