TI  - Spleen assessment after laparoscopic transperitoneal left adrenalectomy: preliminary results
T2  - SURGICAL ENDOSCOPY AND OTHER INTERVENTIONAL TECHNIQUES
LA  - English
KW  - Laparoscopic adrenalectomy
KW  - Wandering spleen
KW  - Endocrine surgery
KW  - Minimally invasive surgery
