TI  - Wandering spleen as a cause of mesenteric and portal varices: A new etiology?
T2  - JOURNAL OF PEDIATRIC SURGERY
LA  - English
KW  - Wandering
KW  - Spleen
KW  - Varices
KW  - Portal
KW  - Mesenteric
