TI  - Gastric Volvulus, Pancreatic Volvulus, and Wandering Spleen: A Rare Emergency Triad Behind Acute Abdomen
T2  - CLINICAL CASE REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - acute abdominal pain
KW  - gastric volvulus
KW  - pancreatic volvulus
KW  - wandering spleen
KW  - MANAGEMENT
