TI  - Wandering spleen in children: multicenter retrospective study
T2  - JOURNAL OF PEDIATRIC SURGERY
LA  - English
KW  - Wandering spleen
KW  - Splenopexy
KW  - Gastropexy
KW  - Splenectomy
