TI  - Diagnosis of multiple splenosis in right thorax and retroperitoneum: a case report and literature review
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF CLINICAL AND EXPERIMENTAL PATHOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Ectopic spleen
