TI  - Gastric volvulus and wandering spleen in Pitt-Hopkins syndrome: first paediatric case report
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PEDIATRICS
LA  - English
KW  - gastric volvulus
KW  - wandering spleen
KW  - Pitt-Hopkins syndrome
