TI  - Splenectomy in Gaucher Disease: A Call for Minimally Invasive Surgery
T2  - SURGICAL LAPAROSCOPY ENDOSCOPY & PERCUTANEOUS TECHNIQUES
LA  - English
KW  - Gaucher disease
KW  - splenectomy
KW  - splenomegaly
