TI  - Laparoscopic splenic procedures in children - Experience in 231 children
T2  - ANNALS OF SURGERY
LA  - English
CP  - 127th Annual Meeting of the American-Surgical-Association
KW  - WANDERING SPLEEN
KW  - SPLENECTOMY
