TI  - Laparoscopic resection of the pancreas - A feasibility study of the short-term outcome
T2  - SURGICAL ENDOSCOPY AND OTHER INTERVENTIONAL TECHNIQUES
LA  - English
KW  - laparoscopic surgery
KW  - pancreas
KW  - short-term outcome
