TI  - Delayed presentation of congenital diaphragmatic hernia with intrathoracic gastric volvulus
T2  - WORLD JOURNAL OF PEDIATRICS
LA  - English
KW  - congenital diaphragmatic hernia
KW  - gastric volvulus
