TI  - Primary Splenic Pregnancy: A Systematic Review of Published Case Reports
T2  - JOURNAL OF CLINICAL MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - splenic pregnancy
KW  - diagnosis
KW  - Augustin's triad
KW  - treatment
KW  - outcome
KW  - systematic review
