TI  - Molecular force-induced liberation of transforming growth factor-beta remodels the spleen for ectopic liver regeneration
T2  - JOURNAL OF HEPATOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Transforming growth factor-8
KW  - glycosaminoglycans
KW  - biomaterials
KW  - liver regeneration
