TI  - Presence and Biometry of Accessory Spleen in Chile Individuals: Study by Computerized Tomography
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF MORPHOLOGY
LA  - Spanish
KW  - Anatomy
KW  - Accessory Spleen
KW  - Imaging
