TI  - THE ACCESSORY SPLEEN: PREVALENCE AND IMAGING FINDINGS IN 1,735 CONSECUTIVE PATIENTS EXAMINED BY MULTIDETECTOR COMPUTED TOMOGRAPHY
T2  - JBR-BTR
LA  - English
KW  - Spleen
KW  - abnormalities
KW  - CT
KW  - FEATURES
